# Attachments are intentionally excluded unless a README keeps the folder visible.
80_Attachments/**
vault-template/80_Attachments/**
!vault-template/80_Attachments/README.md

# Real Daily Notes are personal learning records. The template ships a README
# and the canonical template; do not commit actual dated daily notes.
vault-template/50_LifeOps/Logs/Daily/2*.md

